# Cloudflare Pages redirect rules. Mirrors the `redirects` block in vercel.json
# so srcset.tips and img.style behave identically on both hosts during migration.
#
# Vercel's `redirects` default to permanent (308); matched here so the status
# code does not change under visitors or search engines at cutover.
#
# Note: on Pages, redirects are always followed even when a static asset exists
# at the same path, which matches Vercel's behaviour for `/` today.
/    /en/introduction/    308
